# TypeScript Validation

Before editing TypeScript, inspect `circuits/package.json` and
`circuits/tsconfig.json`. The repository currently defines TypeScript build and
Vitest test scripts, and ESLint scripts.

Use the live repository configuration rather than assuming Airbnb, ESLint
plugins, Prettier integration, or type-aware linting are installed.

Run the smallest applicable command:

- `cd circuits && pnpm build`
- `cd circuits && pnpm test`

Do not add lint suppressions, weaken types, change tooling configuration, or
invent validation commands merely to make a change pass.
